    "steps": [
      "Start Blender with --background --factory-startup.",
      "Run generate_conifer_set.py with topology, transform, base-pivot, camera-radius and budget checks.",
      "Export glTF 2.0 GLB with opaque materials and no cameras, lights, textures or animations.",
      "Reproduce the GLB byte for byte and validate it with the repository policy.",
      "Convert twice with Qt Balsam 6.8.3 and compare every output byte.",
      "Select one of three spruce groves or the Scots-pine grove in WorkoutGameConifer.qml while runtime terrain owns placement and base elevation.",
